{"synopsis":"Suatu hari, tiba-tiba aku menjadi tokoh utama dalam sebuah permainan.\n\nNamun, semakin lama kau melihat tokoh utama ini… semakin kau akan mendesah.\n\nDia memiliki statistik terburuk, bakat terburuk, dan tidak memiliki koneksi sama sekali.\n\nTapi tetap saja…\n\nKau telah memperoleh [Heavenly Martial Physique].\n\nKau telah menjadi penguasa [Martial God’s Tome]. “Jadi apa? Aku pemain veteran terhebat!”\n\nDia bukan hanya pemain veteran—\n\ndia seorang maniak obsesif sejati. Maka dimulailah permainan legendaris seorang veteran sejati!","alternative_title":"무신의 후계자가 되었다","author":"Grubam","artist":"Ji Wook","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"4e921d78-86a5-443d-818c-9649b3afa41b","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"","date":"2025-09-29","released":"2025-09-29","images":["https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eacd3d78-81d3-4f12-9efb-c52cc0f4dc46/chapter_ch_40/1.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eacd3d78-81d3-4f12-9efb-c52cc0f4dc46/chapter_ch_40/2.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eacd3d78-81d3-4f12-9efb-c52cc0f4dc46/chapter_ch_40/3.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eacd3d78-81d3-4f12-9efb-c52cc0f4dc46/chapter_ch_40/4.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eacd3d78-81d3-4f12-9efb-c52cc0f4dc46/chapter_ch_40/5.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eacd3d78-81d3-4f12-9efb-c52cc0f4dc46/chapter_ch_40/6.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eacd3d78-81d3-4f12-9efb-c52cc0f4dc46/chapter_ch_40/7.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eacd3d78-81d3-4f12-9efb-c52cc0f4dc46/chapter_ch_40/8.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eacd3d78-81d3-4f12-9efb-c52cc0f4dc46/chapter_ch_40/9.webp","https://assets.shngm.id/chapter/manga_eacd3d78-81d3-4f12-9efb-c52cc0f4dc46/chapter_ch_40/10.webp"]},{"number":"39","chapter":"39","slug":"ch_39","kc_index":null,"kc_series_slug":null,"date":"2026-08-03"},{"chapter_id":"ea540b0a-8827-4ae9-9f12-cb6798b9ee39","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"","date":"2025-09-21","released":"20